      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this charming three-bedroom, two-bathroom terraced property to the market at No. 5 Priestfield Cottages, Dublin 8. Presented in great condition throughout, this unique home offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a character-filled property in one of Dublin's most desirable and well-connected city locations.\r\n\r\nNestled within a quiet residential enclave, No. 5 Priestfield Cottages enjoys a peaceful setting while remaining just moments from the heart of Dublin City Centre. Dublin 8 has become one of the capital's most sought-after neighbourhoods, celebrated for its rich history, vibrant atmosphere and excellent range of local amenities. Residents can enjoy an abundance of cafés, restaurants, traditional pubs, independent retailers and green spaces, all within walking distance. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous Dublin Bus routes and the LUAS nearby, offering easy access throughout the city. A selection of highly regarded schools, colleges, hospitals and major employment hubs are also within close reach, making this an ideal home for first-time buyers, growing families and investors alike.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property spans approximately 92 sqm of bright, spacious and well-presented accommodation. Briefly comprising of a welcoming entrance hall, a comfortable dining area and separate living room. The rear of the home features a fully fitted kitchen and a bathroom completes the ground floor. Upstairs hosts three generously proportioned double bedrooms and a well-appointed bathroom. A standout feature of this home is the private, low maintenance rear garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nNo. 5 has been carefully maintained and comes to the market in excellent condition, ready for immediate occupation. Boasting a C BER rating, which is particularly impressive for a property of this age, the home also benefits from vacant possession with no onward chain, ensuring a smooth and straightforward purchase process.\r\n\r\nNo. 5 Priestfield Cottages represents a rare opportunity to secure a charming and distinctive home in a prime Dublin 8 location, combining period character with modern comfort and convenience, all within easy reach of the city centre.\r\n\r\n________________________________________\r\nKey Features\r\n•C. 92 sqm of internal floorspace\r\n•BER C\r\n•Charming 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom property\r\n•Presented in great condition throughout\r\n•Vacant possession no onward chain\r\n•Bright and spacious accommodation\r\n•Generous double bedrooms throughout\r\n•Private rear garden\r\n•Full of character and charm\r\n•Newly installed Zoned Combi Boiler\r\n•Quiet and established residential setting\r\n•Prime Dublin 8 location\r\n•Excellent transport links including Dublin Bus and LUAS\r\n•Within walking distance of Dublin City Centre\r\n•Ideal for first-time buyers, families and investors\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nEircode - D08 Y2Y4"
      },
